-- DAT-06 (audit 2026-11-11): one style for hours text. Times as 7pm / 7:30pm (lowercase, no space, no ":00"), one en dash in ranges (5pm–9pm, Fri–Sun),
-- "; check site" as the only way to say the times are estimated, and a trailing "; see site" means "; check site". Produced by normalizeHours() in scripts/event-rules.mjs, which the validator now enforces for new rows.
-- Each change is guarded by the old hours text, so a newer edit is never overwritten.
